This distribution bundles generated parsers derived from Apache Spark's
SqlBaseLexer.g4 and SqlBaseParser.g4 grammar files, which are licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Those grammar files retain their original
Apache-2.0 license headers; see src/sparkscreen/grammar/vendored/.

The sparkscreen source code itself (everything outside the generated and vendored
grammar files) is MIT licensed, as above. The generated parsers are mechanical
transformations of Apache-2.0 licensed grammars and are distributed under those
same terms.